Package: atmos67
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: armhf
Maintainer: atmos67
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgcc-s1, alsa-utils (= 1.2.4-1), linuxptp (= 3.1-2.1), ethtool (= 1:5.9-1)
Description: Kodi passthrough audio to per-speaker AES67 streams
 Decodes the bitstreams Kodi passes through to an ALSA loopback device
 (Dolby Digital, Dolby Digital Plus and TrueHD with Atmos, DTS) for an
 arbitrary speaker layout and sends the speakers as AES67 RTP streams.
 Packaged for OSMC on the Vero V.
